A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the party, racing game known as '''Flapping! Chick Skirmish''' (はばたけ！ひよこ小競争, ''Habatake! Hiyoko Shō Kyōsō '', '''Flapping! Chick Skirmish''') was held from February 19th, 2018 to March 2nd, 2018.<br>
The game is published by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]].

As of June 12th, 2018, the game has been discontinued and can no longer be downloaded.

