==Event==
Characters from [[The Battle Cats]] are available to be unlock in the Flapping! Chick Skirmish app.
*[[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]]
*[[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]]
*[[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]]
*[[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Flower Cat]]
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]
*[[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]]

